### Typst

    Upstream:   https://github.com/typst/typst
    Commit:     9dfd3a08500b7896045f907433cf7b4b02434fad  (tag v0.15.1)
    Licence:    Apache-2.0
    Our image:  agentry-typst
    Context:    build/typst/

Copyright the Typst project developers. Licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Upstream's `LICENSE` and `NOTICE` (its third-party notices) are
shipped in the image under `/licenses/typst/`.

**Changes we make** (Apache-2.0 §4(b)). `build/typst/disable-package-downloads.patch`
modifies two files, and it is shipped in the image beside the licence:

1. `crates/typst-cli/Cargo.toml`: typst-kit's `system-downloader` feature
   (ureq, native-tls, OpenSSL) and the `vendor-openssl` feature are removed.
2. `crates/typst-cli/src/download.rs`: the downloader is replaced by one that
   refuses every request with "package downloads are disabled", so a package
   the local package directory cannot serve is never fetched.

The build also uses `--no-default-features` (no HTTP server, no embedded
fonts) and bases from our mirrors. Nothing built here is a Typst product; the
name identifies the upstream component.

