## Not covered by this file

The images the runner builds **locally on the machine that runs it** — `agentry-runner`
from `agentry-cli/runnerimage/`, the per-release exec images, and the per-release
MCP-server install images — are built by the CLI from contexts embedded in its
own binary, under that repository's licence. This repository changes where their
*bases* come from, not what they are.

## agentry-files

Apache Tika 3.3.2 (https://tika.apache.org), distributed unchanged as its
SHA-512-pinned tika-app jar, is Apache-2.0. Its LICENSE and NOTICE, including
its dependencies' notices, are preserved in the jar's META-INF directory.
OpenJDK, libarchive, libmagic and ClamAV (clamav-scanner, clamav-libunrar
and their dependency freshclam, GPL-2.0-only as Alpine packages them) are
installed from Alpine with their own package licences. The wrapper we add is ours, under MIT.

The sample RAR and 7z fixtures in build/agentry-files/archives are decoded
from libarchive v3.8.1's test_read_format_rar.rar.uu and
test_read_format_7zip_copy.7z.uu, respectively
(https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/tree/v3.8.1/libarchive/test).
Copyright the libarchive contributors, under libarchive's BSD licence;
see build/agentry-files/archives/LICENSE. ZIP and TAR fixtures are ours.

